# Swosh Workspace — Cursor rules

Read and follow AGENTS.md in the repository root. It is the single source of truth for architecture, conventions, security rules and commands.

Key rules: no native browser dialogs (use Modal / useToast), no "R2"/"Cloudflare"/"Vercel" in UI copy, icons only from src/components/Icons.tsx, shared API types in src/types/api.ts, every API route uses requireUser() + owner scoping + enforceRateLimit(), and run `npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm test` before finishing.
